  - {fileID: 32900000, guid: c1581abe70f8ee24c92369f96ef86501, type: 3}
  numberText: {fileID: 1688933612}
  loadingSystem: {fileID: 1695617565}
  tutorialExplanationText: {fileID: 1684316818}
  tutorialExplanation:
  - Use the WASD keys to move the player.
  - "To activate the button with the dashed circle, you need to stand on it vertically.
    \nUse the TAB key on the keyboard to switch between blocks. You can move the
    blocks using the WASD keys."
  - "You can activate the button with the circle by standing on it vertically or
    horizontally. \nThis button can open and close your bridge."
  - "The button with the cross can only be activated when you stand on it vertically.\n
    It also opens or closes your bridge."
  - Watch out for the orange tiles, they are very dangerous.
  - Be careful not to fall off the edge of the map.
  - Look for the open field on the ground on the map, it will take you to the next
    level.
  playPauseImage: {fileID: 180139886}
  playPauseV2Image: {fileID: 1402583858}
  playSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ebb00115ee7ce0b4bb6a33ab049cbf4b, type: 3}
  pauseSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 81c854a064efffa428f08ddcfa60d18a, type: 3}
